      "nom": 1.25,
      "source": "G1 baseline, owner decision OD-COVER 2026-10-11: separate exterior cover lens bonded/sealed to the case; material/thickness PARAMETRIC until the case/display integration study. Values are the 5 ATM plate sizing of the baseline option COVER-SAP-AIR (sapphire class, cover alone carries the pressure, air gap to the display) by tools/g1_scenarios.py: nom = simply-supported edge at nominal planning properties, min = clamped edge at nominal properties, max = simply-supported edge at the conservative corner; conservative upward grid rounding (0.05 mm) is applied directly to the unrounded requirement (the unrounded conservative requirement is ~1.6516 mm, so the grid result is 1.70 mm); g1_scenarios.py check fails if these differ from the sizing. The min-max span covers sizing bounds (edge model and corner), the plate manufacturing tolerance is carried separately (g1_scenarios tolerance policy). Planning material properties, not supplier data (SR-COVER-LENS)."
